# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VoxShield .gitignore
#
# The single most important rule in this repository: source audio, processed
# audio, dataset archives, model weights, and any credential never enter git.
# See docs/privacy-design.md and docs/data-governance.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Data: never commit audio ------------------------------------------------
# Everything under data/ is derived from audio and is regenerated by
# `voxshield data build` / `voxshield ml train`. The directories below cover the
# whole tree, not just the audio ones: manifests, per-segment preprocess caches,
# build reports, and run records all carry corpus-derived content (sample ids,
# paths, durations), and none of it belongs in git. The corpus is fetched, not
# committed; the artefacts it produces are local.
data/**
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/README.md
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus
*.aac
*.pcm

# Dataset archives
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z

# --- Model artifacts ---------------------------------------------------------
# Artefact directories carry a metadata.json / state.json alongside the weights,
# so ignoring the file extensions alone still leaves provenance in `git status`.
data/models/**
reports/**
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.h5
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.safetensors
mlruns/
wandb/
checkpoints/

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/

# --- Editors / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local scratch -----------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
scratch/
*.tmp
